---
title: "Cache writes and recovery"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: No change staged
  s1: Change ready for review
  s2: Write failed
  s3: Cache written with backup
  s4: Backup restored
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: preview
  s1 --> s2: write fails
  s1 --> s3: write and keep backup
  s2 --> s1: retry
  s3 --> s1: preview another change
  s3 --> s4: restore backup
  s4 --> s1: preview another change
